| ₹ 24273 / sq.ft-4% |\n| Mathuradas Road | - | - | - | - |\n| Chandavarkar Road | ₹ 25118 / sq.ft3% | ₹ 24316 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 23764 / sq.ft-2% | ₹ 24149 / sq.ft-3% |\n| Borivali | ₹ 24530 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 24001 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 23455 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 23772 / sq.ft-2% |\n\n## Neev Horizon Photos & Videos\n\n![Neev Horizon photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Horizon photos 1\")\n![Project View in Neev Horizon](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Neev Horizon\")\n\n## About [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Borivali West Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Borivali West Video\")\n\n## About Neev Infrastructure\n\n![Neev Infrastructure](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Infrastructure\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| 'Neev' finds its roots of origination in the Hindi word meaning 'foundation'. At Neev, we not only build the world, but lives too. The Neev group has always been making a difference in enriching the community it serves, by delivering high standards of living, working and infrastructure.    Neev group was established under the able guidance of industry veteran, Mr. Chandulal V Jain in 1978, who envisioned a future with a difference, built on trust, innovation, values and commitment.    In order to achieve organizational excellence there are two dedicated business verticals to handle different facets of the business, real estate and infrastructure. In the real estate vertical, having completed 2.1 million sq. feet of projects, and another 4.5 million sq. feet of work in progress, Neev Homes is a leading player in the residential space.    Over the years Neev Infrastructure has made its mark in the areas of urban infrastructure, industrial infrastructure, water & environment and transportation and is now set to enter progressive sectors like tourism. While we've carried out challenging projects in the last 30 years, we've also been reputed with doing the same in the shortest span of time.    To carry out our unique quest of making a difference to countless lives, we have a skilled team of difference-makers as well. Each of our employees is skilled in his/her discipline, with a willingness to transform the world into a better place.    The trust, togetherness and loyalty which Neev inspires are deeply ingrained in our philosophy and shall continue to grow in the future. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo\")\n![Modispaces Ganges  photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Modispaces Ganges  photo\")\n![Romell Serene photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Romell Serene photo\")\n![Arkade Crown photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Arkade Crown photo\")\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal photo\")\n![Amar Parul Kunj photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Amar Parul Kunj photo\")\n![Mehta Premeire photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mehta Premeire photo\")\n![Nicco Vanashri photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Nicco Vanashri photo\")\n![Lodha Altus photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Lodha Altus photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Neev Infrastructure\n\n![Excella Residency photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Excella Residency photo\")\n![No image available](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"No image available\")\n![Neev Palazzo photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Palazzo photo\")\n![Neev Florentina photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Florentina photo\")\n![Amber Wood photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Amber Wood photo\")\n![Neev Castillo photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Castillo photo\")\n![Ivory Tower photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ivory Tower photo\")\n![Neev Bellevue photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Bellevue photo\")\n![Neev Contour photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Neev Contour photo\")\n![Neev Oasis photo]