er 4.5 million sq. feet of work in progress, Neev Homes is a leading player in the residential space.  \n  \nOver the years Neev Infrastructure has made its mark in the areas of urban infrastructure, industrial infrastructure, water & environment and transportation and is now set to enter progressive sectors like tourism. While we've carried out challenging projects in the last 30 years, we've also been reputed with doing the same in the shortest span of time.  \n  \nTo carry out our unique quest of making a difference to countless lives, we have a skilled team of difference-makers as well. Each of our employees is skilled in his/her discipline, with a willingness to transform the world into a better place.  \n  \nThe trust, togetherness and loyalty which Neev inspires are deeply ingrained in our philosophy and shall continue to grow in the future.  \n  \n**Corporate Address:**  \nNeev Vittoria, Nesbit Road.Next to Mazgaon Sales Tax Office, Mumbai -10.\n\n## Property Deals\n\n* [Luxury Homes](https://www.propertycrow.com/luxury-homes.html)\n* [Corporate Leasing](https://www.propertycrow.com/corporate-leasing.html)\n* [Preleased Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/preleased-properties.html)\n* [Hotels & Resorts](https://www.propertycrow.com/hotels-resorts-restaurants.html)\n* [Warehouse](https://www.propertycrow.com/warehouse.html)\n* [Pre-Launch & Discounted Deals](https://www.propertycrow.com/pre-launch-projects.html)\n* [Distress Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/distress-sale.html)\n* [Real Estate Builders](https://www.propertycrow.com/real-estate-builders.php)\n* [Global Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/global/)\n* [Weekend Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/property_weekend-projects_1_3_0_0_0.html)\n* [Commercial Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/property_commercial-projects_1_2_0_0_0.html)\n* [Residential Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n* [Expat Properties](https://www.propertycrow.com/expat-properties.html)\n\n### 